  tutorials:
  - section: 0
    formula: Subject|Verb 1 (+s/es)|Object / Keterangan
    explanation: I / You / We / They + Verb 1 (read).   He / She / It + Verb 1 +
      s/es (reads, watches, goes).
    exampleSentence: She-reads-books
    exampleRoles: Subject|Verb 1 + s|Object
  - section: 1
    formula: Subject|do / does|not|Verb 1|Object / Keterangan
    explanation: 'I / You / We / They + do not.   He / She / It + does not.   Setelah
      do/does, verb kembali ke bentuk dasar: does not eat (bukan eats).'
    exampleSentence: He-does-not-eat-meat
    exampleRoles: Subject|does|not|Verb 1|Object
  - section: 2
    formula: Do / Does|Subject|Verb 1|Object / Keterangan + ?
    explanation: Do untuk I / You / We / They,  Does untuk He / She / It.   Verb
      tetap bentuk dasar dan kalimat diakhiri tanda tanya (?).
    exampleSentence: Does-he-play-tennis?
    exampleRoles: Does|Subject|Verb 1|Object + ?
